# The clock (QD2, QD3, QD7; X_eTaL-extensions' ask E4): []TS is the
# local time stamp, year month day hour minute second millisecond,
# read each time it is used; []D_L s waits s seconds and gives the
# seconds waited (a Float), at least s.
== SOURCE
s_hape []TS
2026 <= 1 s_elect []TS
([]D_L 0.01) >= 0.01
([]D_L 0) >= 0
== TYPE
Int
Bool
Bool
Bool
== RESULT
7
1
1
1
